Carry what a run established into a continuous integration job

Usage: rust-mutants ci [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  gate  Write a run where the job shows it, and exit with its verdict. On GitHub Actions that is the
        step summary, the step outputs, and one annotation per survivor
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Whether to paint the output. `auto` paints a terminal that has not set `NO_COLOR`

          Possible values:
          - auto:   Colour a terminal that has not asked to go without
          - always: Always
          - never:  Never
          
          [default: auto]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
